    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">Represents shares of common stock issued to the Reporting Person on October 26, 2026 (the &quot;Closing&quot;) pursuant to the Contribution Agreement, dated as of September 8, 2026, by and among FanEngine Holdings Ltd., the Seller Securityholders named therein, GameSquare IP Holdings, Inc., the Issuer and Jesper Schertiger, as Seller Securityholder Representative, in exchange for the contribution of substantially all of the assets of FanEngine Holdings Ltd., representing the Reporting Person's 15.50% Schedule A pro rata percentage of shares equal in aggregate to 30% of the Issuer's common stock outstanding after giving effect to such issuance. All share amounts reflect the Issuer's 1-for-8 reverse stock split effective August 24, 2026.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">Represents shares of common stock issued upon settlement of restricted stock units that vested on October 26, 2026. Each restricted stock unit represents the right to receive one share of common stock.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F3">Each restricted stock unit represents a contingent right to receive one share of common stock.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F4">The restricted stock units (83,700 in the aggregate) were granted on October 26, 2026 under the GameSquare Holdings, Inc. 2026 Stock Incentive Plan in connection with the Reporting Person's service, and vest 25% on October 26, 2026, 37.5% on October 26, 2027 and 37.5% on October 26, 2028, subject to continued service.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F5">Stock option granted on October 26, 2026 under the GameSquare Holdings, Inc. 2026 Stock Incentive Plan with an exercise price of $2.25 per share, which was the fair market value of a share of common stock on the grant date, vesting and becoming exercisable as to 25% (20,925 shares) on October 26, 2026, 37.5% on October 26, 2027 and 37.5% on October 26, 2028, subject to continued service; expiration date October 26, 2036.</footnote>
